  "question": {
    "text": "The coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup></math> in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;",
